        "original_id": "71453cbe-397c-558e-9693-aef3d4f81451",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Neringa Municipality, Klaipėda County, Lithuania, Curonian Spit, Pervalka\n- Organizations: Municipalities of Lithuania, elderships\n\nFacts:\n- Lithuania is divided into 60 municipalities, and those municipalities are further divided into more than 500 elderships.\n- Neringa Municipality is a municipality in Klaipėda County in the westernmost part of Lithuania.\n- Neringa Municipality comprises several villages in the Curonian Spit.\n- Pervalka is administratively part of the city of Neringa.",
